# Vesuva enters as a copy of Gaea's Cradle and copies its legendary supertype and its name (CR 707.2), so Bot1 controls two
# legendary permanents named Gaea's Cradle and the legend rule has Bot1 choose one (CR 704.5j). Bot1 keeps the copy (the
# newer, tapped one): the Gaea's Cradle card goes to the graveyard, not destroyed, and the Vesuva that is a Cradle stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gaea's Cradle
Vesuva
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Gaea's Cradle.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Vesuva.Play
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Gaea's Cradle#2)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Gaea's Cradle
Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Cradle.Supertypes = Legendary
Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Cradle.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Gaea's Cradle
